{"4022640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hold On: The Delivery for the Goose", "steam_appid": 4022640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold On is a lighthearted adventure game about persistence, mistakes, and one very demanding goose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got one job: make sure the delivery arrives. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cozy environments, interact with quirky objects, and overcome silly obstacles as you track down a missing package. The goose won’t wait forever—so hold on, retrace your steps, and maybe even laugh at yourself along the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022640/extras/c2445bd20cf5d7aaee1762b43ea38aca.avif?t=1762588559\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦢 A goose that won’t take excuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 A delivery that never seems to stay put.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Small but charming environments to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 Light puzzle-solving and comedic frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Relaxed atmosphere with playful twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022640/extras/905dbe605983c49ab92de521b7aee682.avif?t=1762588559\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold On is a lighthearted adventure game about persistence, mistakes, and one very demanding goose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got one job: make sure the delivery arrives. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cozy environments, interact with quirky objec